  "solution": {
    "text": "By law of conservation of momentum,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mu</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>MV</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>mv</mi></math>&hellip;(i)<br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8722;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Mu</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Mv</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>MV</mi></math>&nbsp;....(ii)<br />From (i) and (ii), <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>Mu</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>uM</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
